# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate synthetic noise models {#generate-synthetic-noise-models}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng mga synthetic na noise model {#generate-synthetic-noise-models}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before creating the quantum circuits, we generate a noise model ([PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) instance) for each of the entangling layers. We will embed them as instructions in our quantum circuits later. For each layer, we generate noise channels of varying scales. Specifically, we generate noise models with [Error Per Layered Gate (EPLG)](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/quantum-metric-layer-fidelity) of approximately ``.0004, .0008, .0012, .0016,`` and ``.002``.\n"
msgstr "Bago gumawa ng mga quantum circuit, gagawa tayo ng noise model (instance ng [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html)) para sa bawat entangling layer. Isasama natin ang mga ito bilang mga instruction sa ating mga quantum circuit mamaya. Para sa bawat layer, gagawa tayo ng mga noise channel na may iba't ibang scale. Partikular, gagawa tayo ng mga noise model na may [Error Per Layered Gate (EPLG)](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/quantum-metric-layer-fidelity) na humigit-kumulang ``.0004, .0008, .0012, .0016,`` at ``.002``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the quantum circuits {#create-the-quantum-circuits}"
msgstr "Gawin ang mga quantum circuit {#create-the-quantum-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this demo, we simulate the time dynamics of a transverse-field Ising model (TFIM) for increasing numbers of Trotter steps (1-10 steps). For each of the 10 circuit depths, we simulate the effect of gate noise, given noise models of varying scales (``EPLGs = .0004, .0008, .0012, .0016, .002``). The noise is inserted into the ``QuantumCircuit`` as a [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) instruction from Qiskit Aer. The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr "Para sa demo na ito, sini-simulate natin ang time dynamics ng isang transverse-field Ising model (TFIM) para sa dumaraming bilang ng mga Trotter step (1-10 step). Para sa bawat isa sa 10 circuit depth, sini-simulate natin ang epekto ng gate noise, gamit ang mga noise model na may iba't ibang scale (``EPLGs = .0004, .0008, .0012, .0016, .002``). Ipinapasok ang noise sa ``QuantumCircuit`` bilang instruction na [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) mula sa Qiskit Aer. Ang Hamiltonian na isinasaalang-alang ay:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and $h$ is the global transverse field.\n"
msgstr "kung saan ang $J>0$ ay naglalarawan ng coupling ng mga magkatabing spin, $i<j$, at ang $h$ ay ang global na transverse field.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we implement the time-evolved Hamiltonian across various time and noise scales. We create 60 total circuits: 10 noiseless circuits varying in Trotter depth, and 50 noisy circuits for the 10 Trotter depths across five noise scales. Given a connectivity graph, the model is parametrized by a few variables:\n"
"- ``num_steps``: The number of Trotter steps\n"
"- ``J``: Coupling strength of connected sites\n"
"- ``h``: Strength of external magnetic field\n"
"- ``dt``: Change in time across a Trotter step\n"
"- ``initial_state_angle``: An initial excitation, $R_y(\\theta)$, to be applied uniformly to all qubits\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito, ipinapatupad natin ang time-evolved na Hamiltonian sa iba't ibang time at noise scale. Gumagawa tayo ng 60 kabuuang circuit: 10 noiseless na circuit na magkakaiba ang Trotter depth, at 50 noisy na circuit para sa 10 Trotter depth sa limang noise scale. Dahil sa isang connectivity graph, ang model ay pina-parametrize ng ilang variable:\n"
"- ``num_steps``: Ang bilang ng mga Trotter step\n"
"- ``J``: Lakas ng coupling ng mga konektadong site\n"
"- ``h``: Lakas ng external na magnetic field\n"
"- ``dt``: Pagbabago ng oras sa bawat Trotter step\n"
"- ``initial_state_angle``: Isang initial na excitation, $R_y(\\theta)$, na ilalapat nang pantay sa lahat ng qubit\n"

