# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify observable and run simulations {#specify-observable-and-run-simulations}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang observable at patakbuhin ang mga simulation {#specify-observable-and-run-simulations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this demo, we simulate expectation values of the average two-site correlator:\n"
msgstr "Para sa demo na ito, sini-simulate natin ang mga expectation value ng average na two-site correlator:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\langle O \\rangle = \\langle Z_{tot}^2(s) \\rangle = \\frac{1}{N^2}\\sum \\langle \\Psi(\\theta)|(\\mathscr{U}^{\\dagger})^sZ_jZ_k(\\mathscr{U})^s|\\Psi(\\theta) \\rangle$\n"
msgstr "$\\langle O \\rangle = \\langle Z_{tot}^2(s) \\rangle = \\frac{1}{N^2}\\sum \\langle \\Psi(\\theta)|(\\mathscr{U}^{\\dagger})^sZ_jZ_k(\\mathscr{U})^s|\\Psi(\\theta) \\rangle$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\Psi(\\theta)$ corresponds to a uniform $R_y(\\theta)$ rotation on all qubits, $\\mathscr{U}^s$ describes $s$ Trotter layers, and $(j,k)$ index all connected pairs of vertices on the lattice.\n"
msgstr "kung saan ang $\\Psi(\\theta)$ ay tumutugma sa uniform na $R_y(\\theta)$ rotation sa lahat ng qubit, ang $\\mathscr{U}^s$ ay naglalarawan ng $s$ Trotter layer, at ang $(j,k)$ ay nag-i-index sa lahat ng konektadong pares ng vertex sa lattice.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we use ``pauli_prop`` to simulate observable expectation values for each of the circuits. For this nine-qubit demo, we perform all simulations **exactly**. **No Pauli propagation truncation will be performed; therefore, the differences in expectation values across the different noise models can be entirely attributed to the gate error**. The simulation process is handled in four steps:\n"
"- Evolve the Clifford gates in the circuit to the front of the circuit using ``pauli_prop.evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
"- Propagate the observable through the non-Clifford part of the circuit using ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
"  - We perform exact simulations by allowing the observable to grow to the size of the full Pauli space, $4^9$\n"
"- Propagate the evolved observable through the Clifford part of the circuit using Qiskit's ``SparsePauliOp.evolve``\n"
"- Estimate the expectation value with respect to the zero state, $|0\\rangle^{\\otimes N}$, by summing the coefficients of each diagonal term in $O$ (terms containing $Z$ or $I$ on all qubits)\n"
msgstr ""
"Panghuli, gagamitin natin ang ``pauli_prop`` para i-simulate ang mga expectation value ng observable para sa bawat circuit. Para sa nine-qubit na demo na ito, ginagawa natin ang lahat ng simulation nang **eksakto**. **Walang gagawing Pauli propagation truncation; kaya, ang mga pagkakaiba sa mga expectation value sa iba't ibang noise model ay buong maiuugnay sa gate error**. Ang proseso ng simulation ay hinahawakan sa apat na hakbang:\n"
"- I-evolve ang mga Clifford gate sa circuit papunta sa harap ng circuit gamit ang ``pauli_prop.evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
"- I-propagate ang observable sa non-Clifford na bahagi ng circuit gamit ang ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
"  - Gumagawa tayo ng mga eksaktong simulation sa pamamagitan ng pagpapalaki sa observable hanggang sa laki ng buong Pauli space, $4^9$\n"
"- I-propagate ang evolved na observable sa Clifford na bahagi ng circuit gamit ang ``SparsePauliOp.evolve`` ng Qiskit\n"
"- Tantiyahin ang expectation value kaugnay ng zero state, $|0\\rangle^{\\otimes N}$, sa pamamagitan ng pagsasama-sama ng mga coefficient ng bawat diagonal na term sa $O$ (mga term na naglalaman ng $Z$ o $I$ sa lahat ng qubit)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe effect of gate error on the model {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"
msgstr "Obserbahan ang epekto ng gate error sa model {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remember that, since this is a nine-qubit experiment, the Pauli propagation routine is exact, and all of the error in the noise plots can be attributed to gate error.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan na, dahil nine-qubit na eksperimento ito, eksakto ang Pauli propagation routine, at ang lahat ng error sa mga noise plot ay maiuugnay sa gate error.\n"

